Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they jumping up and down for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're grouchy\Nbecause they're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.36,0:00:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
