Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.82,0:00:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life, these things shall\Nnot vanish from the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.08,0:01:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.14,0:01:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonder!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.36,0:01:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.72,0:01:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live how we want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us,\Nwe have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.10,0:01:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll live in wonderland.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.45,0:02:15.24,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(900,0)\blur0.5\3c&H0D0A08&\c&H0D0A08&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(855,900,\1a&H00&)}The Summit
Dialogue: 2,0:02:12.45,0:02:15.24,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(900,0)\bord0\blur0.6\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}The Summit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.90,0:02:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Wapol!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol and his men have\Ncome back to the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.08,0:02:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.99,0:02:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.91,0:02:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton headed up to Bighorn to meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.02,0:02:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who can fight, grab a\Nweapon and head to Bighorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your weapons and head for Bighorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow Dalton all the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow Dalton to Bighorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.40,0:02:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waple's back on the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.66,0:02:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, arm yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to protect our country!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.14,0:02:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.08,0:02:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,March to Bighorn! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.76,0:02:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Phoebe,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you sure we're going\Nin the right direction
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get to this piasta\Ntown where the witch is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now that you mention it, I'm\Nnot exactly sure where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're in pretty bad\Nshape if you're not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.98,0:02:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.89,0:02:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if Luffy and Sanji manage to make it to\Nthe castle and the doctor isn't there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.06,0:03:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll just turn around and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to make it to the\Nplace, find the doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.98,0:03:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and tell her to go back up the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami is running out of\Ntime pretty quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.34,0:03:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I realize that, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you realize that,\Nthen do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a princess, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.90,0:03:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that have to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.34,0:03:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't snap my fingers\Nand make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a princess, not a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what? Well, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go ahead and\Ntake a look at the map?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.16,0:03:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's snow covering everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, if we keep to this route,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should see a sign for this\Npiasta place somewhere along it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.93,0:03:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll watch for signs of the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'll miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen closely, citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything in this country can be\Nmade into my snack if I want it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I am a great man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.96,0:03:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know why I'm great?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.44,0:04:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kurumai. Mo. Explain to them. The reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the greatest man in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are the king your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.18,0:04:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right. Exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.34,0:04:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if I want to eat a house I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,expect it to be served to my liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.31,0:04:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol, sir. I have some\Ninformation for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.51,0:04:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have received a report that some of the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat brats very\Ninconsiderately set out for
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,drum castle after they arrived\Non the island your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.04,0:04:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd they do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears that they took a sick woman\Nup the mountain to see her doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.27,0:04:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a dumb idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.10,0:04:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one lives there now,\Nespecially not a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, well, I actually heard that Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.70,0:04:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo, also very inconsiderately,\Nis currently living in Drum Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a crazy old hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman is living in my castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare she mock me in such a way?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.28,0:04:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll eat her up along with Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:04:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll show them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men, we're going back to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.80,0:05:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.22,0:05:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to see you dead, so\Nthat really suits me just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just entered your own king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be difficult to fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.92,0:05:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we live in an advanced\Nmedical nation with almost two
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.36,0:05:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dozen well-qualified doctors\Nto service his every need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,20 MDs emergency medical unit,\Nprepare. Heel, heel. Start operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.02,0:05:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start operation. Scalpel.\NNeedle. Thin. And hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was sure I was gonna\Ndie for a minute there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Wapol, let's leave\Nthis country together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.26,0:06:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't stay in the land we betrayed\Nany longer. It's wrong. It's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.82,0:06:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am still your king, Dalton. He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.98,0:06:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll shut your mouth if you\Nknow what's good for you The three
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.86,0:06:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of us including you were in the\Nhighest position among Waple's men.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.18,0:06:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were his loyal servants,\Nor have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No Dalton wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.36,0:06:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.95,0:06:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one in the government\Nwho tried to protect us You're
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only one who fought for us\Nwhile he was destroying the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stood up for us
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have died, Dalton,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.10,0:06:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and your post is captain of the\NTrump Kingdom security guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you all survived\Nin this country without any doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our country is internationally acknowledged\Nfor its development in medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that renown is nothing\Nmore than a cheap charade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one could guess that there\Nare actually only 20 doctors
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who were shut up doing\Nresearch in the King's own lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that all the other doctors\Nhave been exiled from the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leaving the citizens to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.86,0:06:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.77,0:06:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who gets sick or injured must come\Nand beg for their life if they want help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:06:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I feel like it\Nmaybe I'll lend them the 20
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MDs services if they want\Nto stay alive and healthy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All they have to do is obey me their king!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way no one will\Ndare challenge my rule
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that is the perfect\Nway to govern a country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't real governing waffle,\Nand you aren't a real king!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you certainly speak your\Nmind Dalton now kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.98,0:07:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to shoot your former captain\Nas usual You don't understand a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I served your father before\Nyou and he was always
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a good man and a fair\Nruler I hoped you might
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come to resemble him one\Nday But I see now that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.70,0:07:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that was a lot of wishful\Nthinking Not good,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.26,0:07:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's using the ox ox fruit\NHe's in his bison form
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't back down. Just fire him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.84,0:07:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't hit him He just dodges\NNo mercy, even to my ex-soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:07:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fiddle-Bam, attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.89,0:08:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the kind of power the\NZone-type Devil Fruit will give?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.87,0:08:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had it with you\Npathetic so-called rulers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There can be no hope for a\Ncountry where the king and his men
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.18,0:08:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are the first ones to abandon the\Npeople during a time of crisis!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how well you do\Nfighting against the two of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.18,0:08:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've come to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let us fight with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to protect our country!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, I've known you a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.85,0:08:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what your weaknesses are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you shield us\Nfrom that shot? Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.88,0:09:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you I knew where\Nyour weak spot was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice guys always finish last.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite a fitting death, huh boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.49,0:09:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to go any\Nfurther in this deep snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like we've gone\Npartially up the mount.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's the ground shaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.42,0:09:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.32,0:09:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An apple branch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, they've really done it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.78,0:09:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What isn't good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on with the bunnies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.56,0:09:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.47,0:09:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to run, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.82,0:09:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're running again? We're two!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anywhere, as long as\Nit's far away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because there's about to be\Nan avalanche, that's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.04,0:10:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, those stupid overgrown bunnies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.30,0:10:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we get away from all this snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.76,0:10:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know is that the\Nfirst priority is Nami,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the second priority is Nami,\Nand the third priority is Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got that, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.30,0:10:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect her even if it kills you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how do I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.67,0:10:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head for that cliff! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.22,0:10:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get as high\Nup as we possibly can!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.23,0:11:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it up here just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.04,0:11:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't high up enough, movie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.42,0:11:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.86,0:11:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.77,0:11:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.48,0:11:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.39,0:11:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab a hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.20,0:11:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for that, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.60,0:11:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.51,0:11:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we don't sink in the snow, we're\Njust gonna keep flying down this mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unless we do something about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.40,0:11:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.31,0:11:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never gonna let that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've come all this way, and we were\Nalmost to the base of the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just feet away from the doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.60,0:11:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you need to come up with\Na way to stop all this right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all because of those damn bunnies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time I see them, I'm gonna\Nturn them into a big ball of stew!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.06,0:11:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, rabbit stew?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.34,0:11:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing we can do at the moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slide faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is their problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.98,0:12:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.78,0:12:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't crash into that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.94,0:12:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one in charge of\Nkeeping Nami safe right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.64,0:12:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's easy for you to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.68,0:12:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies get treated gently,\Nso you take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.86,0:13:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing got me good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time you do something\Nlike that, warn me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.02,0:13:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.12,0:13:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.00,0:13:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not stopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole village will be swallowed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.98,0:13:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.44,0:13:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, Kuzan, get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.16,0:14:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robson, Serious Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol, sir! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.54,0:14:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to let us ride, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can all find your own way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.82,0:14:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robinson, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's closing in on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.01,0:14:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise, Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.58,0:14:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we get buried by this,\NI'll be able to save you, I'm sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bloofy and the others headed\Nup in that direction, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think the avalanche could\Nhave already gotten to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.28,0:15:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, I'm sure you're cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.86,0:15:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, hang on to this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was you guys in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.46,0:15:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder it had such a disgusting taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let him get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.58,0:15:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.66,0:15:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You told me earlier that some of the Straw
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hats headed up the\Nmountain toward my castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then this happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have a grudge against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.22,0:16:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're still mad about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.66,0:16:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they climbed up there\Nand started an avalanche!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.54,0:16:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, they were the ones who caused it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.86,0:16:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those sinister Straw Hat\NPirates caused the avalanche!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.95,0:16:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, boys, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see if those\Nstupid sea-loving sailors
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know anything about fighting in the snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.66,0:16:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you there. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.66,0:17:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.57,0:17:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see the brats up ahead, Wapol, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.78,0:17:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'll make you pay, you damn Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of\Nmaking it easy for you and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.44,0:18:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those half-dead friends of\Nyours to get away from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.18,0:18:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.82,0:18:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chess, I've thought up a\Nnew law to celebrate my return.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.72,0:18:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Write this down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.63,0:18:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.55,0:18:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who ignores the\Nking will be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those three are guilty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chess, Karoo Marimo, I want\Nthem to be punished immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.24,0:18:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deal with the two unconscious ones first\Nsince they're ignoring me them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did he say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got the woman on his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.70,0:18:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.70,0:18:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for Marmo's Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.18,0:19:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Luffy, I don't want you\Nfighting these guys, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.40,0:19:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami will be able to\Nfeel every move you make.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's too sick to be able to\Nhandle something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.90,0:19:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She could die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.10,0:19:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.34,0:19:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna regret this\Nlater, don't follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, what a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.14,0:19:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time he learned what a\Nbattle in the snow is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they've already given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.92,0:19:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's what a snow battle's really like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.06,0:19:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow powder makeup, the white disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are so incredibly weak\Nthat just one shot should be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's checkmate. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.14,0:20:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polar bears?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loppins!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.94,0:20:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did those things just protect him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.14,0:20:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.18,0:20:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loppins never form bonds with humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.20,0:20:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're nothing more than wild beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, you guys saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are those stupid\Nbunnies doing standing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.42,0:21:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.72,0:21:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's tall and straight up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the doctor's up there,\Nso I gotta climb it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.36,0:21:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Nami and Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.36,0:21:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just a little further to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.92,0:22:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.36,0:22:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The avalanche.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.18,0:22:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have buried us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.62,0:22:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.54,0:23:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.22,0:23:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.46,0:23:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.84,0:23:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get you out\Nof there, Usopp, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.14,0:23:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hang on a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.32,0:23:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Usopp, please just wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.68,0:23:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.96,0:23:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me a few more\Nminutes here, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.16,0:23:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was in the middle of\Nsuch a lovely dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.90,0:23:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a world far away from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.82,0:23:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sitting in a field of flowers with a\Nbeautiful river flowing next to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.00,0:23:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.91,0:23:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're crossing over into\Nthe afterlife, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.50,0:23:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to get out of that dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.72,0:23:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.50,0:23:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, look at the Usopp pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.16,0:23:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All 74,000 of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.78,0:23:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're such good, brave warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.52,0:23:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, get up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.76,0:23:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.80,0:23:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.78,0:23:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Usopp! Usopp! Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.38,0:23:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.77,0:23:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.68,0:23:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved my life, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.60,0:23:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was almost a goner there for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.51,0:23:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm lucky to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.42,0:23:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one, really so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.34,0:24:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except that my face feels kind of swollen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.25,0:24:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.16,0:24:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.08,0:24:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.99,0:24:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an unfortunate side\Neffect of a snowy area.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.54,0:24:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.45,0:24:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's the cold or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.37,0:24:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What matters now is figuring out\Nwhere we are and what to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.12,0:24:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any lip balm or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.70,0:24:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.14,0:24:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.96,0:24:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I feel like I dreamed\Nabout a field of flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.56,0:24:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit by an avalanche in the\Nmiddle of a training session.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.32,0:24:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not exactly an ideal workout, but I guess\Nit is kind of like swimming in snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.06,0:24:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.97,0:24:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Vivi. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.90,0:24:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.02,0:24:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.60,0:24:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing all\Nthe way out here in the snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.96,0:24:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what we\Nwere going to ask you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.18,0:24:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that, you stupid\Nbunnies, you pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.90,0:24:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,creatures got exactly\Nwhat you deserve for!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.92,0:24:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going up against the king\Nstill annoys me that I had to
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.68,0:25:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,expend so much of my power against\Na pack of overgrown rabbits!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.32,0:25:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was no helping it sir they are\Nthe fiercest animals in Drum Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.42,0:25:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're next?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.80,0:25:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.66,0:25:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,argh! argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.22,0:25:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.36,0:26:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,!ARGH! !ARGH! !ARGH!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.54,0:26:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,!ARGH !ARGH !ARGH!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.45,0:26:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ARGH!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.44,0:26:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.42,0:26:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Winter swimming?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.74,0:26:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was the idea anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.02,0:26:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after swimming in the river for a\Nwhile, I had no idea where I was anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.68,0:26:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I started walking around doing\Nsome strength training workouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.24,0:26:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dressed like that in cold weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.88,0:26:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're real stupid, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.28,0:26:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.34,0:26:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now would you shut up and\Ngive me your coat, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.30,0:26:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.70,0:26:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Nami's sick from the mental\Nexhaustion of dealing with these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.92,0:26:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how about your shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.12,0:26:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope. Just one, then. I said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.42,0:26:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did this to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.46,0:26:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.54,0:26:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's some people over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.96,0:26:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.46,0:26:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.00,0:26:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at those buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.54,0:26:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seem familiar, don't they? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.04,0:26:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.38,0:26:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is Bighorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.94,0:26:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.30,0:26:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks a lot different\Nburied in snow, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.06,0:27:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.14,0:27:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton's already dead, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.26,0:27:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd take more than a couple\Nflimsy arrows to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.14,0:27:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're his men.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.05,0:27:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or used to be, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.18,0:27:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you care at all about\Nwhat happens to Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.58,0:27:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.66,0:27:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all Wapol soldiers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.40,0:27:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And any one of you who opposes\NWapol is as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.50,0:27:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.90,0:27:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.84,0:27:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.46,0:27:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.34,0:27:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton is buried under the snow\Nthat came down with the avalanche.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.96,0:27:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.08,0:27:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton's under that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.04,0:27:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.30,0:27:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we can't get over there to dig him\Nout because those guys are blocking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.12,0:27:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the last time, stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.94,0:27:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you really want\Nto dig your friend up,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.00,0:27:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you can go ahead\Nand try fighting us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.02,0:27:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp, I think I\Nremember their clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.68,0:27:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the same exact guys who attacked\Nour ship when we were out in the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.12,0:27:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.03,0:27:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.50,0:27:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they're the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.64,0:28:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad guys, not our friends, you follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.10,0:28:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.84,0:28:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.20,0:28:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't so brave without Dalton around.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.54,0:28:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Zoro! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.72,0:28:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.16,0:28:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.74,0:28:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing good will come\Nfrom attacking them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.40,0:28:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.98,0:28:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really like this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.78,0:28:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you wanted\Nto know who they were?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.36,0:28:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.46,0:28:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't look very happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.84,0:28:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.75,0:28:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were on the ship with that guy\Nwho beat up Wapol, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.44,0:28:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.35,0:28:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a little slow, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.36,0:29:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.12,0:29:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.92,0:29:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.46,0:29:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you die on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.10,0:30:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.24,0:30:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.64,0:31:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.30,0:31:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.78,0:32:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.69,0:32:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ine, the antibodies seem to be responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.44,0:32:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, as I'd guess they would.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.40,0:32:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The treatment worked, but what\Nwas the cause of the illness?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.88,0:32:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kestia.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.46,0:32:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kestia, that's exactly correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.54,0:32:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you go and attend\Nthe girl, all right? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.42,0:32:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.96,0:33:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.36,0:33:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life has been too still,\Nmy heart is unfulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.28,0:33:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you could be the one to set me free.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.54,0:33:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something has to change,\Nmy world can rearrange!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.20,0:33:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything as\Nlong as you are with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.76,0:33:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've grown stronger having you by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.56,0:33:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've started on an everlasting ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.60,0:34:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm invincible when your love is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.92,0:34:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm with you I have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.52,0:34:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how far we can make this go?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.88,0:34:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.20,0:34:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your pride I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.20,0:34:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see it shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.90,0:34:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the distance, glistening like water.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.62,0:34:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the sun rises in the dawn.

